---
// AssetVsLiability.astro
---
<section id="audit" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-brand-card/40 relative border-t border-brand-primary/10 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">The <span class="text-brand-orange">#1 Mistake</span> 90% of Local Businesses Make.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-muted">They buy cheap "Brochure" websites that look okay but generate ZERO revenue. You don't need a digital brochure. You need a Digital Asset.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">

      {/* The Old Way */}
      <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-10 border-brand-orange/20 animate-on-scroll relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-orange/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-muted mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-orange" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 14l2-2m0 0l2-2m-2 2l-2-2m2 2l2 2m7-2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          The Standard "Brochure" Site
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-brand-muted">
            <span class="text-brand-orange mt-0.5 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Acts like a leaky bucket—visitors arrive and immediately leave to find a competitor.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-brand-muted">
            <span class="text-brand-orange mt-0.5 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Buried on Page 5 of Google while the business next door gets all the phone calls.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-brand-muted">
            <span class="text-brand-orange mt-0.5 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Confusing layout that actually makes it harder for customers to give you money.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* The Apex Way */}
      <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-10 border-brand-green/30 relative overflow-hidden transform md:-translate-y-4 shadow-glow-green animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-green/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 right-8 bg-brand-green text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">The Apex Solution</div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          High-Converting Digital Asset
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white">
            <span class="text-brand-green mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Engineered with consumer psychology to force visitors to take action.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white">
            <span class="text-brand-green mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Aggressive Local SEO architecture to dominate the top 3 spots on Google.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white">
            <span class="text-brand-green mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
            <span class="font-medium">Builds instant, subconscious authority so you can charge premium prices.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
